msgstr "Instalação do \"AccountsService\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/accountsservice.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, rename a directory whose presence prevents the build system from "
"running if <xref linkend=\"python-dbusmock\"/> is not installed:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, renomeie um diretório cuja presença impede o sistema de construção"
" de executar se <xref linkend=\"python-dbusmock\"/> não estiver instalado:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/accountsservice.xml:115
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>mv tests/dbusmock{,-tests}</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>mv tests/dbusmock{,-tests}</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/accountsservice.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Then fix a test script so that the new directory is found, and adapt it for "
"Python 3.12.0 or later:"
msgstr ""
"Em seguida, corrija um conjunto de comandos sequenciais de teste, de forma "
"que o novo diretório seja encontrado e adapte-o para Python 3.12.0 ou "
"posterior:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/accountsservice.xml:122
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e '/accounts_service\\.py/s/dbusmock/dbusmock-tests/' \\\n"
"    -e 's/assertEquals/assertEqual/'                      \\\n"
"    -i tests/test-libaccountsservice.py</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e '/accounts_service\\.py/s/dbusmock/dbusmock-tests/' \\\n"
"    -e 's/assertEquals/assertEqual/'                      \\\n"
"    -i tests/test-libaccountsservice.py</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/accountsservice.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Fix one test that fails if the <option>en_IE.UTF-8</option> locale is not "
"installed:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija um teste que falha se a localidade <option>en_IE.UTF-8</option> não "
"estiver instalada:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/accountsservice.xml:131
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/^SIMULATED_SYSTEM_LOCALE/s/en_IE.UTF-8/en_HK.iso88591/' "
"tests/test-daemon.py</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i '/^SIMULATED_SYSTEM_LOCALE/s/en_IE.UTF-8/en_HK.iso88591/' "
"tests/test-daemon.py</userinput>"

